  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0: two-pass language detection with exclusive-marker disambiguation. CavemanLanguageDetector now runs a second pass that checks for words unique to each language (exclusive markers), eliminating false positives caused by shared words like \"per\", \"a\", \"in\", \"via\" across English, Italian and Dutch. FunctionWordProvider gains GetExclusiveMarkers(iso3) backed by new embedded .excl.yaml.br files for 7 curated languages (eng, ita, fra, deu, spa, por, nld). Curated-preference tiebreak prefers hand-curated languages over YAML-only results when scores are close. All changes are additive and backward-compatible.",
